  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Do you think technology has changed our lives?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, absolutely, technology has changed our lives. Since we have phones and apps, we can connect with people over really long distances — and even see their faces. Technology also helps us learn skills more easily. Like, I can learn English from videos now. But in the old days, if you wanted to learn a new language, you had to actually go there and communicate with the local people, without any translations. Nowadays we have AI and apps to learn languages — it's so useful. In fact, I'm talking with you over a computer right now, and we're talking about technology. Even the IELTS test can be taken online these days.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 2.53,
      "end": 37.67
    }
  ],
